{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48445","headline":"劝进疏引谶 三 · 不详","name":"劝进疏引谶 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西北天火照，龙山昭童子，赤光连北斗。\n童子木上悬白幡，胡兵纷纷满前後。\n拍手唱堂堂，驱羊向南走。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}